Save once, then put only the checks in `expect(...).toPass()`. The block retries if *any* check fails; the 10-second timeout covers the backend’s ~5-second delay.

```ts
const newName = 'New Name';
const expectedAvatarSrc = '/avatars/new-name.png'; // Use the URL your app generates.

await page.getByLabel('Name').fill(newName);
